r/turn-messages:opacity-100 group-focus-within/turn-messages:pointer-events-auto group-focus-within/turn-messages:opacity-100 has-data-[state=open]:pointer-events-auto has-data-[state=open]:opacity-100" style="mask-position: 0% 0%;"><button class="text-token-text-secondary hover:bg-token-bg-secondary rounded-lg" aria-label="Copiar" aria-selected="false" data-testid="copy-turn-action-button" data-state="closed"><span class="touch:w-[38px] flex h-[30px] w-[30px] items-center justify-center"><svg width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" class="icon-md-heavy"><path fill-rule="evenodd" clip-rule="evenodd" d="M7 5C7 3.34315 8.34315 2 10 2H19C20.6569 2 22 3.34315 22 5V14C22 15.6569 20.6569 17 19 17H17V19C17 20.6569 15.6569 22 14 22H5C3.34315 22 2 20.6569 2 19V10C2 8.34315 3.34315 7 5 7H7V5ZM9 7H14C15.6569 7 17 8.34315 17 10V15H19C19.5523 15 20 14.5523 20 14V5C20 4.44772 19.5523 4 19 4H10C9.44772 4 9 4.44772 9 5V7ZM5 9C4.44772 9 4 9.44772 4 10V19C4 19.5523 4.44772 20 5 20H14C14.5523 20 15 19.5523 15 19V10C15 9.44772 14.5523 9 14 9H5Z" fill="currentColor"></path></svg></span></button></div></div></div></div></div></div></article><article class="text-token-text-primary w-full" dir="auto" data-testid="conversation-turn-6" data-scroll-anchor="false" style=""><h6 class="sr-only">ChatGPT Plus</h6><div class="text-base my-auto mx-auto py-5 [--thread-content-margin:--spacing(4)] @[37rem]:[--thread-content-margin:--spacing(6)] @[72rem]:[--thread-content-margin:--spacing(16)] px-(--thread-content-margin)"><div class="[--thread-content-max-width:32rem] @[34rem]:[--thread-content-max-width:40rem] @[64rem]:[--thread-content-max-width:48rem] mx-auto flex max-w-(--thread-content-max-width) flex-1 text-base gap-4 md:gap-5 lg:gap-6 group/turn-messages focus-visible:outline-hidden" tabindex="-1"><div class="group/conversation-turn relative flex w-full min-w-0 flex-col agent-turn"><div class="relative flex-col gap-1 md:gap-3"><div class="flex max-w-full flex-col grow"><div data-message-author-role="assistant" data-message-id="428b28ca-813d-49a9-9ee0-9185e9d0274d" dir="auto" class="min-h-8 text-message relative flex w-full flex-col items-end gap-2 text-start break-words whitespace-normal [.text-message+&amp;]:mt-5" data-message-model-slug="gpt-4o"><div class="flex w-full flex-col gap-1 empty:hidden first:pt-[3px]"><div class="markdown prose dark:prose-invert w-full break-words dark"><p data-start="0" data-end="93">Aquí tienes el contenido de las imágenes resumido y organizado en una tabla clara y sencilla:</p>
<div class="_tableContainer_16hzy_1"><div tabindex="-1" class="_tableWrapper_16hzy_14 group flex w-fit flex-col-reverse"><table data-start="95" data-end="1268" class="w-fit min-w-(--thread-content-width)"><thead data-start="95" data-end="140"><tr data-start="95" data-end="140"><th data-start="95" data-end="125" data-col-size="sm"><strong data-start="97" data-end="108">Aspecto</strong></th><th data-start="125" data-end="140" data-col-size="xl"><strong data-start="127" data-end="138">Resumen</strong></th></tr></thead><tbody data-start="186" data-end="1268"><tr data-start="186" data-end="227"><td data-start="186" data-end="215" data-col-size="sm"><strong data-start="188" data-end="214">Nombre de la actividad</strong></td><td data-col-size="xl" data-start="215" data-end="227">Asamblea</td></tr><tr data-start="228" data-end="269"><td data-start="228" data-end="257" data-col-size="sm"><strong data-start="230" data-end="250">Edad recomendada</strong></td><td data-col-size="xl" data-start="257" data-end="269">2-3 años</td></tr><tr data-start="270" data-end="346"><td data-start="270" data-end="299" data-col-size="sm"><strong data-start="272" data-end="295">Nº de participantes</strong></td><td data-col-size="xl" data-start="299" data-end="346">Todos los niños y niñas que asistan a clase</td></tr><tr data-start="347" data-end="393"><td data-start="347" data-end="376" data-col-size="sm"><strong data-start="349" data-end="372">Duración aproximada</strong></td><td data-col-size="xl" data-start="376" data-end="393">10-15 minutos</td></tr><tr data-start="394" data-end="520"><td data-start="394" data-end="423" data-col-size="sm"><strong data-start="396" data-end="409">Objetivos</strong></td><td data-col-size="xl" data-start="423" data-end="520">- Conocer las partes del cuerpo<br>- Interactuar con el cuerpo<br>- Respetar a los compañeros</td></tr><tr data-start="521" data-end="558"><td data-start="521" data-end="550" data-col-size="sm"><strong data-start="523" data-end="534">Espacio</strong></td><td data-col-size="xl" data-start="550" data-end="558">Aula</td></tr><tr data-start="559" data-end="718"><td data-start="559" data-end="588" data-col-size="sm"><strong data-start="561" data-end="584">Recursos materiales</strong></td><td data-col-size="xl" data-start="588" data-end="718"><strong data-start="590" data-end="604">Fungibles:</strong> Pinturas, folios, cartulinas, goma eva<br><strong data-start="647" data-end="664">No fungibles:</strong> Cuento, fotos de los niños, impresora, hojas reales</td></tr><tr data-start="719" data-end="882"><td data-start="719" data-end="752" data-col-size="sm"><strong data-start="721" data-end="751">Desarrollo de la actividad</strong></td><td data-col-size="xl" data-start="752" data-end="882">Se recibe a los niños y se les pide sentarse en círculo. Se presentan con su foto y se fomenta la participación con preguntas.</td></tr><tr data-start="883" data-end="1268"><td data-start="883" data-end="913" data-col-size="sm"><strong data-start="885" data-end="912">Criterios de evaluación</strong></td><td data-col-size="xl" data-start="913" data-end="1268">Se usa una lista de control con observaciones individuales. Ejemplos de criterios:<br>- Participa verbalmente<br>- Repite canciones o saludos<br>- Sigue rutinas sociales<br>- Respeta normas del grupo<br>- Identifica elementos del calendario o clima<br>- Presta atención<br>- Se incorpora por iniciativa propia<br>- Participa en canción, cuento y juego</td></tr></tbody></table><div class="sticky end-(--thread-content-margin) h-0 self-end select-none"><div class="absolute end-0 flex items-end" style="height: 32.7188px;"><span class="" data-state="closed"><button class="bg-token-bg-primary hover:bg-token-bg-tertiary text-token-text-secondary my-1 rounded-sm p-1 transition-opacity group-[:not(:hover):not(:focus-within)]:pointer-events-none group-[:not(:hover):not(:focus-within)]:opacity-0"><svg width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" class="icon-md-heavy"><path fill-rule="evenodd" clip-rule="evenodd" d="M7 5C7 3.34315 8.34315 2 10 2H19C20.6569 2 22 3.34315 22 5V14C22 15.6569 20.6569 17 19 17H17V19C17 20.6569 15.6569 22 14 22H5C3.34315 22 2 20.6569 2 19V10C2 8.34315 3.34315 7 5 7H7V5ZM9 7H14C15.6569 7 17 8.34315 17 10V15H19C19.5523 15 20 14.5523 20 14V5C20 4.44772 19.5523 4 19 4H10C9.44772 4 9 4.44772 9 5V7ZM5 9C4.44772 9 4 9.44772 4 10V19C4 19.5523 4.44772 20 5 20H14C14.5523 20 15 19.5523 15 19V10C15 9.44772 14.5523 9 14 9H5Z" fill="currentColor"></path></svg></button></span></div></div></div></div>
<p data-start="1270" data-end="1321" data-is-last-node="" data-is-only-node="">¿Deseas este resumen en formato Word o PDF también?</p></div></div></div></div><div class="flex min-h-[46px] justify-start"><div class="touch:-me-2 touch:-ms-3.5 -ms-2.5 -me-1 flex items-center p-1 select-none -mt-1 w-full duration-[1.5s] focus-within:transition-none hover:transition-none pointer-events-none [mask-image:linear-gradient(to_right,black_33%,transparent_66%)] [mask-size:300%_100%] [mask-position:100%_0%] motion-safe:transition-[mask-position] group-hover/turn-messages:pointer-events-auto group-hover/turn-messages:[mask-position:0_0] group-focus-within/turn-messages:pointer-events-auto group-focus-within/turn-messages:[mask-position:0_0] has-data-[state=open]:pointer-events-auto has-data-[state=open]:[mask-position:0_0]" style="mask-position: 0% 0%;"><button class="text-token-text-secondary hover:bg-token-bg-secondary rounded-lg" aria-label="Copiar" aria-selected="false" data-testid="copy-turn-action-button" data-state="closed"><span class="touch:w-[38px] flex h-[30px] w-[30px] items-center justify-center"><svg width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" class="icon-md-heavy"><path fill-rule="evenodd" clip-rule="evenodd" d="M7 5C7 3.34315 8.34315 2 10 2H19C20.6569 2 22 3.34315 22 5V14C22 15.6569 20.6569 17 19 17H17V19C17 20.6569 15.6569 22 14 22H5C3.34315 22 2 20.6569 2 19V10C2 8.34315 3.34315 7 5 7H7V5ZM9 7H14C15.6569 7 17 8.34315 17 10V15H19C19.5523 15 20 14.5523 20 14V5C20 4.44772 19.5523 4 19 4H10C9.44772 4 9 4.44772 9 5V7ZM5 9C4.44772 9 4 9.44772 4 10V19C4 19.5523 4.44772 20 5 20H14C14.5523 20 15 19.5523 15 19V10C15 9.44772 14.5523 9 14 9H5Z" fill="currentColor"></path></svg></span></button><button class="text-token-text-secondary hover:bg-token-bg-secondary rounded-lg" aria-label="Respuesta adecuada" aria-selected="false" data-testid="good-response-turn-action-button" data-state="closed"><span class="touch:w-[38px] flex h-[30