je" aria-selected="false" data-state="closed"><span class="touch:w-[38px] flex h-[30px] w-[30px] items-center justify-center"><svg width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" class="icon-md-heavy"><path fill-rule="evenodd" clip-rule="evenodd" d="M13.2929 4.29291C15.0641 2.52167 17.9359 2.52167 19.7071 4.2929C21.4784 6.06414 21.4784 8.93588 19.7071 10.7071L18.7073 11.7069L11.6135 18.8007C10.8766 19.5376 9.92793 20.0258 8.89999 20.1971L4.16441 20.9864C3.84585 21.0395 3.52127 20.9355 3.29291 20.7071C3.06454 20.4788 2.96053 20.1542 3.01362 19.8356L3.80288 15.1C3.9742 14.0721 4.46243 13.1234 5.19932 12.3865L13.2929 4.29291ZM13 7.41422L6.61353 13.8007C6.1714 14.2428 5.87846 14.8121 5.77567 15.4288L5.21656 18.7835L8.57119 18.2244C9.18795 18.1216 9.75719 17.8286 10.1993 17.3865L16.5858 11L13 7.41422ZM18 9.5858L14.4142 6.00001L14.7071 5.70712C15.6973 4.71693 17.3027 4.71693 18.2929 5.70712C19.2831 6.69731 19.2831 8.30272 18.2929 9.29291L18 9.5858Z" fill="currentColor"></path></svg></span></button></div></div></div></div></div></div></article><article class="text-token-text-primary w-full" dir="auto" data-testid="conversation-turn-12" data-scroll-anchor="true" style="min-height: calc(-248px + 100dvh);"><h6 class="sr-only">ChatGPT Plus</h6><div class="text-base my-auto mx-auto py-5 [--thread-content-margin:--spacing(4)] @[37rem]:[--thread-content-margin:--spacing(6)] @[72rem]:[--thread-content-margin:--spacing(16)] px-(--thread-content-margin)"><div class="[--thread-content-max-width:32rem] @[34rem]:[--thread-content-max-width:40rem] @[64rem]:[--thread-content-max-width:48rem] mx-auto flex max-w-(--thread-content-max-width) flex-1 text-base gap-4 md:gap-5 lg:gap-6 group/turn-messages focus-visible:outline-hidden" tabindex="-1"><div class="group/conversation-turn relative flex w-full min-w-0 flex-col agent-turn"><div class="relative flex-col gap-1 md:gap-3"><div class="flex max-w-full flex-col grow"><div class="flex flex-wrap gap-2"></div><div class="flex flex-wrap gap-2"></div><div data-message-author-role="assistant" data-message-id="5ba4a06d-ce33-4f19-9907-4cd4cf132bb6" dir="auto" class="min-h-8 text-message relative flex w-full flex-col items-end gap-2 text-start break-words whitespace-normal [.text-message+&amp;]:mt-5" data-message-model-slug="gpt-4o"><div class="flex w-full flex-col gap-1 empty:hidden first:pt-[3px]"><div class="markdown prose dark:prose-invert w-full break-words dark"><p data-start="0" data-end="190">Actualmente no puedo convertir el archivo a PDF directamente desde aquí debido a limitaciones técnicas. Sin embargo, puedes hacerlo fácilmente en tu ordenador siguiendo uno de estos métodos:</p>
<h3 data-start="192" data-end="227">✅ Opción 1: Usar Microsoft Word</h3>
<ol data-start="228" data-end="383">
<li data-start="228" data-end="274">
<p data-start="231" data-end="274">Abre el archivo <code data-start="247" data-end="254">.docx</code> que te proporcioné.</p>
</li>
<li data-start="275" data-end="317">
<p data-start="278" data-end="317">Haz clic en <strong data-start="290" data-end="316">Archivo &gt; Guardar como</strong>.</p>
</li>
<li data-start="318" data-end="361">
<p data-start="321" data-end="361">Selecciona <strong data-start="332" data-end="339">PDF</strong> como tipo de archivo.</p>
</li>
<li data-start="362" data-end="383">
<p data-start="365" data-end="383">Guarda el archivo.</p>
</li>
</ol>
<h3 data-start="385" data-end="417">✅ Opción 2: Usar Google Docs</h3>
<ol data-start="418" data-end="546">
<li data-start="418" data-end="463">
<p data-start="421" data-end="463">Sube el archivo <code data-start="437" data-end="444">.docx</code> a tu Google Drive.</p>
</li>
<li data-start="464" data-end="490">
<p data-start="467" data-end="490">Ábrelo con Google Docs.</p>
</li>
<li data-start="491" data-end="546">
<p data-start="494" data-end="546">Ve a <strong data-start="499" data-end="545">Archivo &gt; Descargar &gt; Documento PDF (.pdf)</strong>.</p>
</li>
</ol>
<p data-start="548" data-end="699" data-is-last-node="" data-is-only-node="">Si prefieres que intente generar el PDF de otra forma, puedo seguir buscando una alternativa. ¿Te gustaría eso? <span class="" data-state="closed"><button><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" viewBox="0 0 19 15" fill="none" class="text-token-link hover:text-token-link-hover ms-0.5 -mt-0.5 inline-block" width="19" height="15"><path d="M4.42 0.75H2.8625H2.75C1.64543 0.75 0.75 1.64543 0.75 2.75V11.65C0.75 12.7546 1.64543 13.65 2.75 13.65H2.8625C2.8625 13.65 2.8625 13.65 2.8625 13.65C2.8625 13.65 4.00751 13.65 4.42 13.65M13.98 13.65H15.5375H15.65C16.7546 13.65 17.65 12.7546 17.65 11.65V2.75C17.65 1.64543 16.7546 0.75 15.65 0.75H15.5375H13.98" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"></path><path d="M5.55283 4.21963C5.25993 3.92674 4.78506 3.92674 4.49217 4.21963C4.19927 4.51252 4.19927 4.9874 4.49217 5.28029L6.36184 7.14996L4.49217 9.01963C4.19927 9.31252 4.19927 9.7874 4.49217 10.0803C4.78506 10.3732 5.25993 10.3732 5.55283 10.0803L7.95283 7.68029C8.24572 7.3874 8.24572 6.91252 7.95283 6.61963L5.55283 4.21963Z" fill="currentColor" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="0.2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"></path><path d="M9.77753 8.75003C9.3357 8.75003 8.97753 9.10821 8.97753 9.55003C8.97753 9.99186 9.3357 10.35 9.77753 10.35H13.2775C13.7194 10.35 14.0775 9.99186 14.0775 9.55003C14.0775 9.10821 13.7194 8.75003 13.2775 8.75003H9.77753Z" fill="currentColor" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="0.1"></path></svg></button></span></p></div></div></div></div><div class="flex min-h-[46px] justify-start"><div class="touch:-me-2 touch:-ms-3.5 -ms-2.5 -me-1 flex items-center p-1 select-none -mt-1 w-full duration-[1.5s] focus-within:transition-none hover:transition-none pointer-events-none [mask-image:linear-gradient(to_right,black_33%,transparent_66%)] [mask-size:300%_100%] [mask-position:100%_0%] motion-safe:transition-[mask-position] group-h